    "text": "Based on the search results, here is your Week Ahead briefing: US Dollar strength dominates as hawkish Federal Reserve expectations continue supporting the greenback across major FX pairs , setting the dominant macro theme for the coming week. Fed rate hike bets remain elevated ahead of key US PCE data , making this the most important data release affecting the dollar this week. Watch USD/JPY closely as Fed pricing is the dominant driver for USD/JPY this week with markets now shifting from debating rate cuts to whether the Fed may need to tighten policy further . The biggest wildcard remains traders awaiting fresh developments surrounding the US-Iran conflict before taking stronger directional positions , adding geopolitical uncertainty that could quickly shift risk sentiment.",
